{"about_the_game":"In the <strong>80 levels</strong> you will find many challenges: moving plataforms, barries, mirrors and many more that will make you think for hours.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819330/extras/e9507053517df654c73fc36373218212.poster.avif?t=1591819172\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819330/extras/e9507053517df654c73fc36373218212.webm?t=1591819172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/819330/extras/e9507053517df654c73fc36373218212.mp4?t=1591819172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Move multiple the dots freely by join them together into a snake, that travels through the scene. Your main goal is to form squares with 4 or 9 dots, the game ends when no more dots are left;<br><br>Each puzzle can be solved in many ways, but try to make the most squares that you can at the same time to earn better scores;<br><br>The dot have three different colors: red, green, blue, you can only make squares using dots with matching colors.<br><br>Have fun ;)<br><i>Mental Lab Team</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e76da0a731033e4818bb0787c094ee0517ad2e7d.jpg","localized_name":"We're Square","name":"We're Square","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/819330/e76da0a731033e4818bb0787c094ee0517ad2e7d.jpg"},{"icon":"48541a88a14403b57e4e204e55af1ef1579a0b7a.jpg","localized_name":"Even Bigger","name":"Even Bigger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/819330/48541a88a14403b57e4e204e55af1ef1579a0b7a.jpg"},{"icon":"4ed37193461cced49255c0ee1e267dc824938f9b.jpg","localized_name":"First Combo","name":"First Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu